silm:instances_papers_16_one_integrated_growing_knowledge_graph_chapters_02_cross_entity_reference_arrows_sections_03_sees_as_patient_concrete_anchors silm:hasExample "In 'SeesAsPatientConcreteAnchors', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, Dr. Patel the household-registered veterinarian, presented as the colimit of her DEA number, her clinic, her chart roster, and her authored records." .
